@startuml Batch Type Transitions
!define BATCH_TYPE_COLOR #E1F5FE
!define TRANSITION_COLOR #FFF9C4
!define ROW_TYPE_COLOR #F3E5F5

title Gluten Batch Type Transition Graph

' Batch Types
state "VanillaBatchType" as VanillaBatch BATCH_TYPE_COLOR
state "ArrowJavaBatchType" as ArrowJava BATCH_TYPE_COLOR
state "ArrowNativeBatchType" as ArrowNative BATCH_TYPE_COLOR
state "VeloxBatchType" as Velox BATCH_TYPE_COLOR
state "VanillaRowType" as VanillaRow ROW_TYPE_COLOR

note right of ArrowJava
  **ArrowJavaBatchType**
  - Java Arrow-based columnar batch
  - Uses ArrowWritableColumnVector
  - Compatible with vanilla batch
  - Provides valid get<type>(...) implementations
end note

note right of ArrowNative
  **ArrowNativeBatchType**
  - Native Arrow-based columnar batch
  - Uses IndicatorVector as first vector
  - Optimized for native processing
end note

note right of Velox
  **VeloxBatchType**
  - Velox backend columnar batch
  - Native Velox format
  - High-performance execution
end note

' Transitions between batch types
ArrowJava --> VanillaBatch : Transition.empty\n(no-op, compatible)
ArrowJava --> ArrowNative : **OffloadArrowDataExec**\nOffload to native
ArrowNative --> ArrowJava : **LoadArrowDataExec**\nLoad to Java
ArrowNative --> Velox : **ArrowColumnarToVeloxColumnarExec**\nConvert to Velox

' Row to Batch transitions
VanillaRow --> Velox : **RowToVeloxColumnarExec**\nRow to Velox batch
Velox --> VanillaRow : **VeloxColumnarToRowExec**\nVelox batch to Row

' Reverse transition (empty)
Velox --> ArrowNative : Transition.empty\n(no conversion needed)

legend right
  **Transition Types:**
  - Solid arrows: Active transitions with operators
  - Dashed arrows: Empty transitions (no-op)
  
  **Operator Colors:**
  - Light Blue: Batch Types
  - Light Yellow: Transition Operators
  - Light Purple: Row Type
  
  **Key Operators:**
  - LoadArrowDataExec: Native → Java Arrow
  - OffloadArrowDataExec: Java → Native Arrow
  - ArrowColumnarToVeloxColumnarExec: Arrow → Velox
  - RowToVeloxColumnarExec: Row → Velox
  - VeloxColumnarToRowExec: Velox → Row
endlegend

@enduml